We are at a restaurant in Panampilly Nagar.
Outside, it is raining heavily.
I have invited Anitha, Prakash, and Deepa for my birthday.
We sat around a nice table inside.
The restaurant is very cozy and bright.
We looked at the menu.
"I have ordered some spicy food," I tell them.
"That is very good for this cold," Prakash says.
Soon, the waiter brought the food.
We got hot parottas, beef roast, and chicken curry.
We shared and ate everything.
"The food is very tasty," Deepa says.
"Maya, have you tried this chicken curry?" Anitha asks.
"Yes, I ate a little," I reply.
We can hear the loud sound of the rain outside.
But inside, it is nice and warm.
My first birthday dinner here went very beautifully.
